~ start
if first == true:
	=>< Introduction
	set first = false
else:
	=>< Reintroduction
if check_feathers():
	What will you do?
	- ... (Give)
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers()
		do save_npc()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do doom_player()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END
else:
	What will you do? 
	- ??? [if check_feathers()]
		=>< Give_Dialogue
		do give_feathers()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Take)
		=>< Take_Dialogue
		do take_feathers()
		do disappear()
		=> END
	- ... (Ignore)
		=> END

~ Introduction
NPC: Hello.
 => END

~ Reintroduction
NPC: Hello again.
 => END

~ Give_Dialogue
NPC: Thank you.
 => END

~ Take_Dialogue
NPC: How rude.
 => END